    <!-- FOSS Advocacy Text -->
    <section class="foss-section">
        <div class="container">
            <p>Being FOSS advocates we were well aware of the mature, high-quality, out-of-the-box, low-cost Free and Open Source (FOSS) technology that was available and this cued the 'wait a minute...' moment.</p>
        </div>
